Spec: Route group

Purpose:
  An original ride and the rides that followed it, split for the comparison sheet.

Owns:
  ./route_group.dart
  /test/domain/route_group_test.dart

References:
  /docs/specs/history/20-followed-rides.md

Must:
  A follow is complete at a coverage of `0.9` or more; a missing coverage is partial.
  The best time is the shortest positive duration among the original and complete follows,
    shown only when at least two compete; a tie keeps the older ride.
  A follow competes with its time on the route; the original competes with its whole duration.
  The complete follows are listed fastest first, so the best time is on top; equal times and untimed rides
    (`0` ms, last) keep the older ride first. Partial follows stay oldest first.
